{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Last Case</i> is a single player realistic escape room game based on a real murder case from 1950s. You're a detective trying to figure out what happened to two young boys that were murdered and thrown in the local river.<br><strong>Are you ready to solve the mystery?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108620/extras/940659575f84481bda30e1440dd0df56.poster.avif?t=1767122529\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108620/extras/940659575f84481bda30e1440dd0df56.webm?t=1767122529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108620/extras/940659575f84481bda30e1440dd0df56.mp4?t=1767122529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108620/extras/dfec68e4d5c532eb985a51cac4ef08ff.webp?t=1767122529\" width=216 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108620/extras/1d1439daabd5476d452a0464a4217b93.poster.avif?t=1767122529\" width=1126 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108620/extras/1d1439daabd5476d452a0464a4217b93.webm?t=1767122529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108620/extras/1d1439daabd5476d452a0464a4217b93.mp4?t=1767122529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108620/extras/d23eb36d0f4d14c9c37caa93a2ce817c.webp?t=1767122529\" width=180 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108620/extras/4f20077a37b7ddfb7fea61db24d6fa30.poster.avif?t=1767122529\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108620/extras/4f20077a37b7ddfb7fea61db24d6fa30.webm?t=1767122529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108620/extras/4f20077a37b7ddfb7fea61db24d6fa30.mp4?t=1767122529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is simple: <strong>find out what really happened.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no combat sequences or jump scares - just <strong>pure investigation</strong>, <strong>atmospheric storytelling</strong>, and <strong>immersive environments</strong> that pull you into the case.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108620/extras/ff573629a108d8aff76bcbefd691f498.webp?t=1767122529\" width=216 height=36 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigate and observe</strong>- Explore, find evidence, hidden objects, and piece together the truth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve logical puzzles</strong>\u00a0- Unlock doors, decode messages, and piece together events from the past.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive atmosphere</strong>\u00a0- Vintage visuals, ambient sound design, and period-accurate details bring the 1950s setting to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interact with the environment</strong> - Destroy, examine, interact, listen, and solve the mystery.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108620/extras/081c1cb29dd90161b61bf274f715517f.webp?t=1767122529\" width=216 height=36 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inspired by a real case</strong>\u00a0- A grounded, emotionally charged mystery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmosphere-driven storytelling</strong>\u00a0- Built around silence, tension, and discovery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic tone</strong>\u00a0- Each location and scene is designed to feel like part of a true crime film.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vintage scenery</strong> - Furniture, old radios, and faded documents, recreates the murder setting.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108620/extras/14a68dc5eb26be5dd29881b4f869bda0.webp?t=1767122529\" width=216 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the 1950s ,two boys were murdered and thrown into a local river. The case went cold for many years and was solved decades later. Crime, corruption, mystery, and lack of justice surround this case. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why would somebody harm two innocent boys, and who is trying to cover it up? </strong><br><br><strong>To find out what happened, solve the &quot;Last Case&quot;.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4108620?t=1767122529","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108620/3accd0e142169c658adda0160d313756180298bf/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767122529","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108620/d2a78c6ab1888c8f0a62edf216c98be6e78ba002/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767122529","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108620/d2a78c6ab1888c8f0a62edf216c98be6e78ba002/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767122529","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Last Case</i> is a single player realistic escape room game based on a real murder case from 1950s. You're a detective trying to figure out what happened to two young boys that were murdered and thrown in the local river.<br><strong>Are you ready to solve the mystery?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108620/extras/940659575f84481bda30e1440dd0df56.poster.avif?t=1767122529\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108620/extras/940659575f84481bda30e1440dd0df56.webm?t=1767122529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108620/extras/940659575f84481bda30e1440dd0df56.mp4?t=1767122529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108620/extras/dfec68e4d5c532eb985a51cac4ef08ff.webp?t=1767122529\" width=216 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108620/extras/1d1439daabd5476d452a0464a4217b93.poster.avif?t=1767122529\" width=1126 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108620/extras/1d1439daabd5476d452a0464a4217b93.webm?t=1767122529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108620/extras/1d1439daabd5476d452a0464a4217b93.mp4?t=1767122529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108620/extras/d23eb36d0f4d14c9c37caa93a2ce817c.webp?t=1767122529\" width=180 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108620/extras/4f20077a37b7ddfb7fea61db24d6fa30.poster.avif?t=1767122529\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108620/extras/4f20077a37b7ddfb7fea61db24d6fa30.webm?t=1767122529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108620/extras/4f20077a37b7ddfb7fea61db24d6fa30.mp4?t=1767122529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is simple: <strong>find out what really happened.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no combat sequences or jump scares - just <strong>pure investigation</strong>, <strong>atmospheric storytelling</strong>, and <strong>immersive environments</strong> that pull you into the case.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108620/extras/ff573629a108d8aff76bcbefd691f498.webp?t=1767122529\" width=216 height=36 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigate and observe</strong>- Explore, find evidence, hidden objects, and piece together the truth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve logical puzzles</strong>\u00a0- Unlock doors, decode messages, and piece together events from the past.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive atmosphere</strong>\u00a0- Vintage visuals, ambient sound design, and period-accurate details bring the 1950s setting to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interact with the environment</strong> - Destroy, examine, interact, listen, and solve the mystery.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108620/extras/081c1cb29dd90161b61bf274f715517f.webp?t=1767122529\" width=216 height=36 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inspired by a real case</strong>\u00a0- A grounded, emotionally charged mystery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmosphere-driven storytelling</strong>\u00a0- Built around silence, tension, and discovery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic tone</strong>\u00a0- Each location and scene is designed to feel like part of a true crime film.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vintage scenery</strong> - Furniture, old radios, and faded documents, recreates the murder setting.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108620/extras/14a68dc5eb26be5dd29881b4f869bda0.webp?t=1767122529\" width=216 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the 1950s ,two boys were murdered and thrown into a local river. The case went cold for many years and was solved decades later. Crime, corruption, mystery, and lack of justice surround this case. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why would somebody harm two innocent boys, and who is trying to cover it up? </strong><br><br><strong>To find out what happened, solve the &quot;Last Case&quot;.</strong></p>","developers":["Berina M"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108620/9de9bbb8eee985666312225b9a07f6c87ded90dd/header.jpg?t=1767122529","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4108620/1209074912/0996a57654bddbe5d905f452f013bba5ea9635ac/1762087529/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762808553","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4108620/1209074912/0996a57654bddbe5d905f452f013bba5ea9635ac/1762087529/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762808553","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4108620/1209074912/0996a57654bddbe5d905f452f013bba5ea9635ac/1762087529/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762808553","id":257225762,"name":"Last Case","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257225762/4566e28a0edc2004d4d9a4dd61b2569373573c5c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1762808553"}],"name":"Last Case","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 4th gen / AMD Ryzen 3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050 / AMD RX 560 / Intel Iris Xe | 2GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 10th gen / AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1660 Super / AMD RX 580 | 6GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX: